Meltdown Popsicles on my menu!!! The flavor combos are...again, Amazing! Your first bites (or licks) are a surprise, you taste the \"normal\" flavors. For me it was the Strawberry but then as it finishes you are left with the most perfect complementary flavor basil! I also tried the Rosewater saffron and it was the same....Rosewater complemented by saffron! These people are Popsicle magicians!"},{"business_id":"EMfJpVozzk238AM51H18Dw","review_id":"SBWIgYbKxkJGl28LhzZk8Q","date":"2010-08-10T02:07:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9264984726905823,"text_excerpt":"This was a great find! We stopped in for popsicles on a really hot day and we were pleased to find so many unique flavors. In my opinion, the best ones are the salted caramel and the strawberry basil. We all shared so I also got to try pineapple cilantro, blackberry lemon lavendar and a melon honey (not sure of the exact name). They even sell cool t-shirts! This is a great treat. :)"},{"business_id":"EMfJpVozzk238AM51H18Dw","review_id":"h_IwK2dGW8e0gZEYVotTEw","date":"2011-04-17T01:36:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.92377769947052,"text_excerpt":"This place serves the most unique popsicles I've ever tried, but I don't know if it was AS good as most of these reviews would lead you to believe. We tried the salted caramel and the strawberry hibiscus - both were definitely delicious, but not out of this world. If you're trekking around the French Quarter on a hot day these are well worth the $3 with the fruit flavors being particularly refreshing. Be careful not to miss the place as it's a very small shop tucked away on a busy street."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EMfJpVozzk238AM51H18Dw","photo_id":"RP5zkRnyuVNVL1no5Z_qlA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RP5zkRnyuVNVL1no5Z_qlA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8895573616027832},{"business_id":"EMfJpVozzk238AM51H18Dw","photo_id":"3Oc4QOKRUiq7vSgf0uMaZA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/3Oc4QOKRUiq7vSgf0uMaZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8283013701438904},{"business_id":"EMfJpVozzk238AM51H18Dw","photo_id":"pgASl5TKtF2CkrZavbjkLw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/pgASl5TKtF2CkrZavbjkLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7991854548454285},{"business_id":"EMfJpVozzk238AM51H18Dw","photo_id":"dhRBqG6cVLH7hyXDsOieYQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/dhRBqG6cVLH7hyXDsOieYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7890689373016357}]},"notebook_case":null}
